## 4. Permitted distribution (Ducky OS client services)

This section applies only to Ducky OS (the platform core and its official
plugins). You may:

- Share copies within your organization, including employees and contractors
  under confidentiality.
- Run Ducky OS to build, host, customize, and maintain websites or
  applications for paying clients, and deliver a site to that client under
  this same license, where the service you sell is your labor, design, or
  operations rather than the Software itself.

Operating a "Ducky OS as a Service" or similar managed platform for third
parties to run their own sites is not permitted under this section.

Official builds, signed binaries, and the update channel for UEFN-Ducky are
distributed exclusively through uefnducky.org and its designated mirrors.
Official Ducky OS builds are distributed exclusively through duckyos.org and
its designated mirrors.

